; PT35 (#932): the result of AutoCAD 2021 for autocad-rectang-opzioni.scr (Matleyx78/dxf-test-file,
; commit d5fe8e419b90d0c2bf32e0ce652c03c0c7dfd3f9, CC0-1.0; second session of 2026-11-22,
; docs/tappe/0.8.1/dxf-di-prova.md). The expected values of rectang/opzioni come from here;
; the Oracolo ezdxf step of the CI compares these answers with ezdxf.
D = DXF source=autocad-rectang-opzioni
? version D -> AC1032
? units D -> 4
? count D -> LWPOLYLINE 8
? unhandled D -> none
; a: Rotation with Pick points from 0,0 to 4,3 (u = 0.8,0.6), Dimensions 40 x 20, towards 60,60
? entity D 8C -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=0,0 vertex=32,24 vertex=20,40 vertex=-12,16
; b: Area 600 from the width 20
? entity D 8D -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=100,0 vertex=130,0 vertex=130,20 vertex=100,20
; c: Width 1 together with Fillet 4: bulges and width both kept
? entity D 8E -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes width=1 vertex=160,4 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=164,0 vertex=196,0 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=200,4 vertex=200,16 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=196,20 vertex=164,20 bulge=0.4142135623730951 vertex=160,16
; d: Chamfer 25 and 25 on a 40 x 20 (does not fit): 8 vertices, every corner twice, no message
? entity D 8F -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=220,0 vertex=220,0 vertex=260,0 vertex=260,0 vertex=260,20 vertex=260,20 vertex=220,20 vertex=220,20
; e: Fillet 15 on a 40 x 20 (does not fit): 8 vertices, no bulge, no message
? entity D 90 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=280,0 vertex=280,0 vertex=320,0 vertex=320,0 vertex=320,20 vertex=320,20 vertex=280,20 vertex=280,20
; f: Rotation 30 and the other corner typed (380,20): sizes are the projections of Q - P, clockwise
? entity D 91 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=340,0 vertex=378.6602540378444,22.32050807568877 vertex=380,20 vertex=341.3397459621557,-2.320508075688768
; g: from the bottom right corner to the top left one: clockwise
? entity D 92 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=440,0 vertex=400,0 vertex=400,20 vertex=440,20
; h: from the top left corner to the bottom right one: clockwise
? entity D 93 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=460,20 vertex=500,20 vertex=500,0 vertex=460,0
